# Prettier's scope is the web UI plus the repo-level JS/JSON tooling files.
# Everything else is Go, generated output, Antora docs, agent tooling, or
# infra config owned by another toolchain — Prettier does not touch it.

# Ignore the whole tree, then re-include what Prettier owns.
/*

!/.agents
!/ui
!/docs
!/package.json
!/eslint.config.mjs
!/.prettierrc.json
!**/*.md

# ...but never these, even inside ui/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/.vite/
ui/src/gen/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

